      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 625989616,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> This MR has broken the macOS build:\n\nOr, rather, it's broken the no-pcap build; that happens to be done only by our buildbot as part of the macOS build, but the issue is with building without pcap, not building on macOS.\n\nAnd the problem is that, without pcap, there's no packet capture, and thus no `global_capture_opts`.",
